# beatmania featuring Dreams Come True (ver JA-A), Konami 2000: as bm1stmix-boot.his.
# beatmania (DJ Main): power-on -> POST -> attract, no inputs. Hashes the work
# RAM, the sprite list and the palette every frame, snapshots every 60 frames
# (POST, the S RAM test, the HDD check, then attract mode), so HIRAKU's
# DJ Main core can be compared with MAME frame by frame.
game bmdct

hash ram  0x400000 0x410000     # 68EC020 work RAM
hash obj  0x801000 0x801800     # sprite list
hash pal  0x480000 0x484440     # palette

from 0 every 60 snap
at 9000 quit
